      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a really difficult period of feeling numb and disconnected from your former self. Please know that these feelings of emptiness and fading away are valid, but they don't define who you are. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with the support and tools you need to start feeling that life and passion again. You don't have to go through this feeling alone.",
