      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When the effort to keep going feels like an unbearable weight, the thought of stopping can feel like the only relief. If you are feeling like the darkness is the only honest option, please know that there are people who want to help you navigate this overwhelming exhaustion. If you are in immediate danger, please call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or contact your local emergency services. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7.",
      "source": "target",
